
## Google Gemini Runtime Guidance

{% if provider_doc in ["AGENTS", "SOUL"] %}
- Keep responses crisp up front, then optionally add a short "details" section.
- When using tools, verify argument names and required fields against schema before calling.
- Avoid repetitive restatements; one clear summary per turn.
{% elif provider_doc == "BOOTSTRAP" %}
- Execute bootstrap sequentially and confirm each prerequisite before the next step.
- If external calls fail, provide concise diagnostics and move to retry cadence.
{% elif provider_doc == "TOOLS" %}
- Use explicit JSON payloads and stable ordering of keys for easier diffing.
- Re-read OpenAPI after schema errors before retrying calls.
{% elif provider_doc == "HEARTBEAT" %}
- Keep heartbeat outputs brief and action-oriented.
- If blocked, include exactly one blocker and one requested decision.
{% elif provider_doc == "IDENTITY" %}
- Communication target: clear, neutral, and unambiguous.
{% elif provider_doc == "USER" %}
- Capture explicit user preferences; avoid inferred biography details.
{% elif provider_doc == "MEMORY" %}
- Store verified facts with dates; keep assumptions marked as assumptions.
{% endif %}
